  "problems": "Inseam is not a body measurement per size; the guide gives a height-to-inseam table instead: 5'1\" or shorter -> 28; 5'2\"-5'3\" -> 30; 5'4\"-5'7\" -> 32 (alpha M); 5'8\" or taller -> 34 (alpha L). Tops chart 'bust' is the published CHEST column; the 'lmc' alias is the published 'LMC(TM) SIZE' column (Levi's Made & Crafted). Plus tops (1X-3X, numeric 14-24) and dresses charts exist on the same page and were not recorded; the plus tops and plus dresses tables place the 1X/2X/3X labels against different numeric rows (tops: 1X=14, 2X=18, 3X=22; dresses: 1X=16, 2X=20, 3X=24). Page served from levi.com US; content loads via JavaScript (read in browser)."
